n controllers, including analog movement, vibration, and seamless switching between controller and keyboard/mouse.Redesigned Settings Menu: New controller settings, improved graphics options, audio controls, and additional customizatio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T03:30:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673046","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3255330-1845383656375700","game_id":"steam-3255330","kind":"announcement","title":"A Brand-New Free Demo of Parasomnia: No REM Is Out Now!","summary":"Hello everyone!After several months of hard work, we're very excited to announce that a brand-new free demo of Parasomnia: No REM is now available on Steam!Since the release of our previous demo, the project has continued to evolve significantly. During this time, we've been working on improving gameplay, atmosphere, and many other aspects that we consider essential to achieving the level of quality we're aiming for in the full game. That's why we decided to take things a step further and develo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T22:19:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656375700","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3255330-1831432155570221","game_id":"steam-3255330","kind":"announcement","title":"Quiet on the outside. Busy on the inside.","summary":"While things may have seemed silent from the outside, development on Parasomnia: No REM has been moving forward steadily behind the scenes.Over the past months, we’ve been focused on reworking previously created content, refining core systems, improving the overall experience, and building entirely new sections of the game. Our current goal is to shape a stronger and more cohesive first chapter that better introduces the world, mechanics, and psychological tension of Parasomnia.This process has ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-01T03:23:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155570221","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3255330-1823191198606561","game_id":"steam-3255330","kind":"announcement","title":"The Unconscious as a Source of Horror","summary":"That was one of the first questions we asked ourselves when we began developing Parasomnia: No REM.We decided to explore a theme never before seen in horror video games: sleepwalking.The game is a first-person psychological horror experience in which the protagonist suffers episodes of sleepwalking that drag him into a world twisted by the traumas of his childhood.The unconscious as a source of terrorThe terror in Parasomnia: No REM is built around the No REM state, a scientifically real state w","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-30T22:22:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823191198606561","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3255330-1815580768435846","game_id":"steam-3255330","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Bug Fixes & Improvements","summary":"Patch Notes – November UpdateThis update for the Parasomnia: No REM demo includes a series of small fixes aimed at improving the overall experience.Fixes and changesFixed crucifix sound not stopping correctly when leaving the area.Fixed a duplicated painting appearing in one of the rooms.Fixed mannequin not respawning correctly under certain conditions.Fixed pickup text prompts not displaying properly.Fixed items being unintentionally “stored” in the inventory when spamming the interact button.F","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-11T21:02:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768435846","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3255330-1814309641576161","game_id":"steam-3255330","kind":"announcement","title":"New Demo Available + Halloween Event Announcement! 🎃","summary":"Hey, everyone!It’s been a while since our last devlog, and today we’re thrilled to share some big news.The Parasomnia: No REM Demo is now officially live on Steam!This marks a major milestone for us and for everyone who has been following the project since its early development. The demo gives players the first real glimpse into the psychological horror experience we’ve been crafting over the past year, exploring the line between dreams and reality.Estimated playtime: 30 to 45 minutes of content","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-10-27T17:14:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1814309641576161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3255330-6212244583174491988","game_id":"steam-3255330","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 Great news! Our game now has a Steam page!","summary":"We are excited to announce that you can now visit our game’s page on Steam and discover everything we have been working on. ⭐ Visit our page here: https://store.steampowered.com/app/3255330/Parasomnia_No_REM/ We invite you to add it to your Wishlist to stay updated on our progress and release. Your support is invaluable as we continue developing the full experience. ✨ Try the Demo: We have also released a Demo on Itch.io. We invite you to try it out and share your feedback with us. We would love","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-10-17T04:06:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6212244583174491988","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3255330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3255330":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3255330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z"},"4127770":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:35Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3255330","app_id":3255330,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e233c6441ee567e95528914f23dc2f32acc2a9ad1fe0688c280ab91270f6927f","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Parasomnia: No REM is a psychological horror game where sleepwalking pulls you into realities twisted by childhood trauma. Explore two interconnected worlds, solve puzzles, and survive the horrors hidden inside your own mind.","publishers":[{"name":"BELS Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"BELS Games"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Parasomnia: No REM - Gameplay Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILE